silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_01_manifest_as_hom_profile_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 01_manifest_as_hom_profile #1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Manifest as Written Hom-Profile' the bare symbol VetRecord anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status.." .
